WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.540 line:73%
Gumagana ba ang
solar panels sa gabi?

c02
00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:05.660 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:10.430 line:73%
Hindi. Kailangan ng liwanag
para gumawa ng kuryente.

c04
00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:12.560 line:73%
Kung solar ang
gamit mo sa gabi,

c05
00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:16.270 line:73%
galing 'yan sa battery
na nag-charge noong araw.

c06
00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:20.960 line:73%
Kapag wala o ubos na ang
battery, grid na ang kukunan.

c07
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:26.570 line:73%
Magkaiba ang solar
generation at stored energy.

cz1
00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:32.180 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:34.990 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
